{"id":"f09b00f006e38f7d08a813e4c3892df4ffeccb3c","axis":"silent","repo":"tinacms/tinacms","sha":"f09b00f006e38f7d08a813e4c3892df4ffeccb3c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"packages/v4/@tinacms/tinacms/_docs/array-field.md","lines":["@@ -106,6 +106,11 @@ t.array({"," `hidden` and `description` on the `of` field of a scalar array fail the build."," Set them on the array."," ","+An array takes `addLabel`, the words on its Add control: \"Add item\" by default,","+and \"Add a block\" on a Blocks field. A template takes `group`, the heading it","+sits under in the block picker (templates without one come first), and","+`description`, one line under its name in the picker.","+"," Every field also takes `description`, `defaultValue` and `hidden`. Refer to"," [Options every field takes](./field-plugins.md#options-every-field-takes)."," ","@@ -262,17 +267,17 @@ Each item is a List card in a card list."," - The Add control ends the list. A list of strings or numbers with no","   `defaultItem` uses a box: type a value, press Enter. Any other list uses a","   button. A block array shows \"Add a block\".","-- An empty list says so. A block array says \"No blocks.\". Any other editable","-  array says \"This list is empty. Add the first item below.\". A read-only array","-  says \"This list is empty.\".","+- An empty list says so only when it has no Add control. A block array says","+  \"No blocks.\". An editable array shows only its Add control. A read-only array","+  says \"No tags.\" for a field labelled \"Tags\"."," - A read-only list has no container, no Add control and no menu. A disabled","   list has no hover and no menu."," "," ### Block picker"," "," \"Add a block\" opens a floating panel named \"Choose a block\". It holds a search","-box (\"Search blocks\") and a flat list of the templates in schema order. The list","-has no group headings.","+box (\"Search blocks\") and the templates in schema order, under the heading each","+sets with `group`. Templates without a `group` come first."," "," - Search matches the template label, without regard to case. When nothing matches, the panel says \"No blocks match.\"","   The search box is empty each time the panel opens.","@@ -288,8 +293,8 @@ has no group headings."," - Focus goes to the search box when the panel opens. Escape, a press outside the","   panel or a pick closes it. After Escape or an outside press, focus returns to","   \"Add a block\".","-- A pick adds the block and closes the panel. The block opens by the depth rule","-  below, and focus moves to it.","+- A pick adds the block and closes the panel. The block opens as its own form","+  level at any depth, and focus moves to its first field."," - The panel does not open when the list is full or the field is disabled."," "," ### Opening an item","@@ -298,7 +303,9 @@ The depth of an item is the depth of its fields: the depth of the array plus"," one (`itemOpensNextLevel` in `editor/form-view-state.ts`). Array positions are"," not levels."," ","-- At depth 1 and 2, the card opens in place. Its head sticks to the top while","+- A block always opens as the next form level, at any depth. Going Up returns","+  focus to its card and scrolls it into view.","+- At depth 1 and 2, any other card opens in place. Its head sticks to the top while","   its fields scroll, two deep at most (`FormLevel` `pinHeaders`)."," - At depth 3 and deeper, the card opens as the next form level. The level","   holds a stand-in `object` node built from the fields of the item"],"additions":15,"deletions":8,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/v4/@tinacms/tinacms/_docs/field-plugins.md","lines":["@@ -120,8 +120,9 @@ The properties of the descriptor:","   `rich-text` field sets it to `false` because it renders its own label area."," - `metadata.drillable` — Set it to `true` when the field can open as its own form","   level. The editor drills in at nesting depth 3 and deeper.","-- `metadata.drillsIn(node)` — Overrides the depth rule for one node. `true`","-  drills in, `false` opens in place, `undefined` keeps the depth rule. The","+- `metadata.drillsIn(node)` — Answers for one node above level 3: `true`","+  drills in, `false` opens in place, `undefined` leaves it to the field. Level 3","+  and deeper drill in whatever it returns. The","   `object` field returns it from `display`."," - `metadata.inlineBox(node)` — For a single-value field. It returns the box a","   list card holds in place of the field's widget, with the settings of that"],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/v4/@tinacms/tinacms/_docs/object-field.md","lines":["@@ -143,8 +143,8 @@ sets the field to `null`."," | `'drillIn'` | A card that opens the object as the next Form level. |"," "," With no `display`, levels 1 and 2 open in place and level 3 and deeper drill","-in. An explicit `display` wins at every depth. The collapsible's open state is","-local: it starts closed and opens when the active field is the object or sits","+in whatever `display` says. An explicit `display` wins at level 1 and 2. The","+collapsible's open state is local: it starts closed and opens when the active field is the object or sits"," inside it. The object's own frame shows only errors on the object; each child"," shows its own."," "],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/v4/@tinacms/tinacms/e2e/block-return.spec.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@","+import { type Page, expect, test } from '@playwright/test';","+","+const PAGE = `/#/collections/page/${encodeURIComponent('content/pages/home.mdx')}`;","+const BLOCKS = 14;","+","+async function addBlocks(page: Page) {","+  await page.goto(PAGE);","+  for (let i = 0; i < BLOCKS; i++) {","+    await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Add a block' }).nth(1).click();","+    await page","+      .getByRole('dialog', { name: 'Choose a block' })","+      .getByRole('button', { name: /^Add Template number 1 / })","+      .click();","+    await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Up to Plain blocks' }).click();","+  }","+}","+","+const viewports = [","+  { width: 1280, height: 720 },","+  { width: 390, height: 844 },","+];","+","+for (const viewport of viewports) {","+  test(`Up from a block keeps the admin in place at ${viewport.width}px`, async ({","+    page,","+  }) => {","+    await page.setViewportSize(viewport);","+    await addBlocks(page);","+    await page.evaluate(() => {","+      const wrapper = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(","+        '[data-slot=sidebar-wrapper]'","+      );","+      const overflow = document.createElement('div');","+      overflow.style.cssText =","+        'position:absolute;top:100%;height:28px;width:1px';","+      if (wrapper) {","+        wrapper.style.position = 'relative';","+        wrapper.append(overflow);","+      }","+    });","+    const cards = page.getByRole('button', { name: /^Item \\d+/ });","+    for (const index of [0, Math.floor(BLOCKS / 2), BLOCKS - 1]) {","+      await cards.nth(index).scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();","+      await cards.nth(index).click();","+      await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Up to Plain blocks' }).click();","+      const grip = page.getByRole('button', {","+        name: `Move Item ${index + 1}`,","+        exact: true,","+      });","+      await expect(grip).toBeFocused();","+      await expect(grip).toBeInViewport();","+      const shifted = await page.evaluate(","+        () => document.querySelector('[data-slot=sidebar-wrapper]')?.scrollTop","+      );","+      expect(shifted).toBe(0);","+    }","+  });","+}"],"additions":58,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/v4/@tinacms/tinacms/src/admin/document-form.tsx","lines":["@@ -26,10 +26,10 @@ import {"," import { Field, FieldNode } from '../editor/field';"," import {","   fieldsAlong,","-  lockAbove,","   holdsRevealedError,","   levelDrillsIn,","   levelsFor,","+  lockAbove,","   type OpenLevel,"," } from '../editor/form-view-state';"," import {"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"package